      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>And it is obligatory, God willing, to consider an investigation of the situation concerning what he revealed</li>\n<li>And the mentioned man will appear in front of you and he will be required to fulfil that which is required of him by the</li>\n<li>Conditions of the \u1e0dam\u0101n (&lsquo;the guarantee against defect&rsquo;) and prevents him from requesting a delay. Indulgence</li>\n<li>And his is not to give him any permission in that matter.</li>\n<li>Then do so, if God wills, by a promise and without any indulgence in that regard.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
